      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/homewood/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Homewood escaped the worst of the 1963 civil rights violence that shook Birmingham, though a bombing occurred in its Rosedale community.",
